# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and in the worktree.
#
# The index is already uniformly LF, but core.autocrlf=true was rewriting
# checked-out files to CRLF. That left package.json, tsconfig.json,
# .eslintrc.json, vitest.config.ts and others permanently flagged as modified
# with an empty `git diff` — status compares raw bytes, diff normalizes them —
# and made every git command on Windows print a wall of "LF will be replaced
# by CRLF" warnings. Pinning eol=lf matches what the index already holds, so
# this changes no file contents.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never normalize or diff these as text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.db binary
*.db-shm binary
*.db-wal binary
